    "rp_founder": {
      "type": "rp-founder",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Who runs this",
        "heading": "I'm not an anonymous plug",
        "text": "<p>I started reselling from my bedroom with one supplier and about £40. Everything I post in the group is something I've ordered myself first — if I haven't used it, it doesn't go in.</p><p>I'm on TikTok every week with my face on camera. If any of this were a scam, that's a strange way to run it.</p>",
        "name": "",
        "role": "Founder, Resell Plug UK",
        "cta_label": "",
        "tiktok_label": "Watch me on TikTok",
        "tiktok_link": "",
        "tone": "raised",
        "anchor": "who"
      }
    },
    "rp_faq": {
      "type": "rp-faq",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Before you buy",
        "anchor": "faq",
        "show_cta": false,
        "cta_text": "",
        "cta_label": "",
        "tone": "flat"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the free group actually free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. No card, no email, no trial that runs out. You join, you read, you ask, and if you never buy anything that's completely fine. The paid community exists for people who want the full vault — it isn't a wall in front of the free chat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know this isn't a scam?",
            "answer": "<p>Fair question, and you shouldn't take my word for it. The vouches channel is public and open before you spend anything — every screenshot in it is from a real member. Join the free group first and watch it for a week. Nothing about that costs you money.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does buying a supplier actually get me?",
            "answer": "<p>The supplier's contact details and their full catalogue, so you can browse everything they make and order directly. It's digital — it lands the moment you pay, and you get an email link as well.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which supplier should I start with?",
            "answer": "<p>Depends on the niche you want to run. They've all been ordered from and checked personally, so it isn't a question of which ones are real — it's which products you want to sell. Ask in the free group and I'll point you at the right one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do they ship to the UK?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, worldwide, using an agent. The full agent walkthrough is included free with anything you buy, and the basics get posted in the free group too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I've never resold anything before. Is this for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — that's most of the group. Start in the free chat, follow the guide, place one small test order through an agent. You don't need stock, a company, or money up front to learn how it works.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q1",
        "q2",
        "q3",
        "q4",
        "q5",
        "q6"
      ]
    },
